error[E0013]: `as` in an alternative must be in parentheses
 --> tests/ui/06-patterns/patterns/as_in_alternatives.cheby:8:5
  |
8 |     Some(_) as x | None => x
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: write `(A as x) | B`, or put `as` after the last alternative to bind the whole pattern

error[E0013]: a pattern has at most one `as` name
 --> tests/ui/06-patterns/patterns/as_in_alternatives.cheby:9:12
  |
9 |     _ as a as b => b
  |            ^^
  |
  = help: bind the value once; use the first name

